Any Plate node can declare a selection level in its `settings` plugin option: its label, its settings form, and where the caret goes when it is selected. Nodes that do get the shared selection levels: Esc selects the level above, a breadcrumb leads from the page to the selected block, and the settings show in the host's `settingsContainer` or in a popover. Blocks inside any container get their position and Move up, Move down and Delete. The accordion uses them. @Humanaice
